Objective: Capture and preserve at least 4 Alien units and defend the Research Labs.  All R&D Labs must also remain intact.

Planet: Valentine's
Clan: Musashi

Notes: The Concord definitely knows there is something wrong on this planet, but we can not move the Labs without losing all of our work.  An invasion force of predominantly Alien fighting units has landed.  They are closing in on our facilities from all sides.  Our force is desperately outnumbered and outgunned.  A slight edge may be the sizable refined gold credit and in the training halls we possess.  Our cause relies on you to successfully defend our labs and to capture some of the Alien units for our scientists to examine.

